<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορμάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send forth, send to war,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1437
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν ἐ.</span>
			<i>bring quickly</i> back, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				151
			</span></i> codd. (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν ναῦν</span>
			<i>start</i> the ship, <i>set</i> it <i>agoing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦφον ἐ. πόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					659
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>set out, start,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.51
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1240
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					162
				</span></i>
			; of arrows, <i>dart from</i> the bow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυφίδες τόξων ἐξορμώμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					274
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				182
			</span></i>; <i>move rapidly, rush,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κεῖσε δεῦρό τ᾽ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					929
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>excite to action, urge on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				788
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ ἐπὶ τὴν ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.1.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				like
			
				Pass.
			, <i>set out, start,</i> esp. in haste, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή σε λάθῃσιν κεῖσ᾽ ἐξορμήσασα</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῦς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.221
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦρο ἐξωρμῶμεν πεζῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.7.17
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>set out from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1131
				</span></i>
			, etc.: metaph., <i>break out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤνθηκεν, ἐξώρμηκεν [ἡ νόσος</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1089
			</span></i>.</div>
